1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:33,957 --> 00:01:34,957
The fire...!

20
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:40,043
Undo your Paralysis Technique, Raizo!

21
00:01:40,043 --> 00:01:41,825
We will both perish!

22
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:55,260
Get out of here!

23
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:56,999
Aye!

24
00:02:02,435 --> 00:02:04,130
Damn, it's scorching!

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,869
Aye...

26
00:02:05,869 --> 00:02:08,217
Scorching enough to kill a man!

27
00:02:09,608 --> 00:02:11,304
Hey, look!

28
00:02:11,304 --> 00:02:12,390
Watch out!

29
00:02:12,391 --> 00:02:14,782
The ceiling's going to collapse!

30
00:02:16,086 --> 00:02:17,521
We're doomed!

31
00:02:28,608 --> 00:02:32,478
You're Jinbe, from the Straw Hat crew!

32
00:02:32,478 --> 00:02:33,956
You're incredible!

33
00:02:34,435 --> 00:02:37,435
The fire has yet to spread that way!

34
00:02:38,521 --> 00:02:40,130
Save yourselves!

35
00:02:40,696 --> 00:02:43,000
Aye! We're in your debt!

36
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,130
Don't go dying yourself!

37
00:02:45,174 --> 00:02:46,826
Aye. Go, now!

38
00:02:46,826 --> 00:02:49,608
Got it!
Everybody, on the double!

39
00:02:49,608 --> 00:02:50,999
Yeah!

40
00:03:03,521 --> 00:03:06,478
Why has the fire spread like this?

41
00:03:06,478 --> 00:03:09,435
Dying in battle is one thing...

42
00:03:09,435 --> 00:03:12,695
...but there will be many more
charred dead from the blaze itself!

43
00:03:26,826 --> 00:03:29,347
It's too dangerous to be here...

44
00:03:29,347 --> 00:03:31,608
We'd best get some distance from here.

45
00:03:35,913 --> 00:03:37,957
Dr. Chopper?

46
00:03:41,347 --> 00:03:43,086
What the blazes...?!

47
00:04:02,826 --> 00:04:05,521
I turned back!

48
00:04:05,521 --> 00:04:08,304
Good for you, Doctor!

49
00:04:08,652 --> 00:04:14,391
The side effects from the
extended gigantification have passed!

50
00:04:14,391 --> 00:04:15,261
Yeah!

51
00:04:15,826 --> 00:04:19,521
I didn't expect to turn into a baby
and an old man at the same time...

52
00:04:20,086 --> 00:04:23,129
The effects are great,
but so are the risks.

53
00:04:23,130 --> 00:04:27,043
And those strong side effects
made me smaller and weaker.

54
00:04:27,043 --> 00:04:30,825
Strong, unpredictable
side effects?

55
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:35,477
Miyagi...
I'm worried about Zoro.

56
00:04:35,478 --> 00:04:38,521
Yes, because of the drug, right?

57
00:04:38,521 --> 00:04:43,695
He had around 20 to 30 broken bones,
on top of being bruised and battered...

58
00:04:44,304 --> 00:04:47,304
In exchange for
the temporary super healing,

59
00:04:47,304 --> 00:04:50,304
he'll suffer twice
as much as he did before, right?

60
00:04:50,304 --> 00:04:52,956
Y-Yes!

61
00:04:54,565 --> 00:04:57,565
Twice as bad as the serious injuries
that immobilized him...

62
00:04:58,260 --> 00:04:59,434
Zoro...

63
00:04:59,957 --> 00:05:01,696
Don't go dying on us!

64
00:05:51,521 --> 00:05:54,130
Who the hell're you?!

65
00:06:00,347 --> 00:06:02,564
H-Hey...

66
00:06:03,565 --> 00:06:06,478
What's going on? I can't...

67
00:06:06,913 --> 00:06:08,435
...move my body!

68
00:06:09,043 --> 00:06:11,825
Don't do it... Stop...!

69
00:06:11,826 --> 00:06:12,912
Don't!

70
00:06:20,174 --> 00:06:22,913
Outta the waaaay!

71
00:06:32,869 --> 00:06:36,130
Where the hell'd you
wander off to, Zoro?!

72
00:06:46,043 --> 00:06:46,956
Dammit!

73
00:06:46,957 --> 00:06:49,826
Why's one of Whitebeard's
commanders here?!

74
00:06:49,826 --> 00:06:52,304
And why's he helping those
stupid newbies?!

75
00:07:12,826 --> 00:07:14,956
let them get the better of me...

76
00:07:14,957 --> 00:07:17,522
Grunts they may be,
they are still Animal Kingdom Pirates.

77
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:21,390
Kiku... Kin'emon...

78
00:07:21,957 --> 00:07:24,174
I hope you were able to
escape without issue.

79
00:07:35,913 --> 00:07:37,478
Cipher Pol!

80
00:07:40,913 --> 00:07:43,609
Indeed, we are Aigis Zero.

81
00:07:44,347 --> 00:07:46,390
We knew you were here, but...

82
00:07:48,174 --> 00:07:51,521
Let's pretend we
never saw each other, Izo.

83
00:07:53,043 --> 00:07:57,390
We are in no position to ignore
what remains of the Whitebeard Pirates...

84
00:07:57,391 --> 00:07:59,826
...for committing a historical crime.

85
00:07:59,826 --> 00:08:04,652
But for now, our business is
with the Straw Hats alone.

86
00:08:07,174 --> 00:08:09,217
Until we meet again, elsewhere.

87
00:08:15,043 --> 00:08:17,434
No. Wait...

88
00:08:17,435 --> 00:08:19,043
...CP-0!

89
00:08:25,782 --> 00:08:29,652
Yamato

90
00:08:31,347 --> 00:08:33,912
Must reach...
must reach in time!

91
00:08:38,957 --> 00:08:40,870
There it is!

92
00:08:44,391 --> 00:08:47,130
And thus shall all...

93
00:08:48,086 --> 00:08:50,825
...be led unto their graves.

94
00:08:51,608 --> 00:08:55,173
No, no!
Wait, I beg of you!

95
00:09:06,435 --> 00:09:07,565
Namuji...

96
00:09:08,608 --> 00:09:10,260
...Glacier Fang!

97
00:09:24,565 --> 00:09:27,912
If this much gunpowder
were to explode,

98
00:09:27,913 --> 00:09:29,696
all would be lost!

99
00:09:32,043 --> 00:09:35,434
You will not make contact
with the gunpowder!

100
00:09:42,217 --> 00:09:44,391
Mahoroba!

101
00:09:57,347 --> 00:10:00,999
Orochi-sama!

102
00:10:21,957 --> 00:10:23,913
Stop it, Big Mom!

103
00:10:23,913 --> 00:10:26,174
Our bosses can't move anymore!

104
00:10:26,174 --> 00:10:30,043
If they take any more than they already have,
they'll die for real!

105
00:10:31,565 --> 00:10:33,956
Give 'em a break, already!

106
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:44,390
Pity from your underlings...
Your reputation's going down the drain!

107
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,739
C'mon, stat!

108
00:10:49,608 --> 00:10:53,521
Boss! Stay with us!
Is he even breathing?!

109
00:10:53,608 --> 00:10:56,651
Save the captain, medics!

110
00:11:05,043 --> 00:11:08,912
Shut up!
This is a battlefield,

111
00:11:08,957 --> 00:11:10,565
you garbage!

112
00:11:11,521 --> 00:11:14,304
God of Lightning, Tenjin!

113
00:11:18,957 --> 00:11:22,696
I'll burn all the garbage,
burnable or not!

114
00:11:32,696 --> 00:11:33,826
That reminds me...

115
00:11:34,565 --> 00:11:38,782
I haven't heard Kaido give
his shout of victory yet.

116
00:11:38,782 --> 00:11:45,347
Don't tell me you're still fooling around
with that half-pint Straw Hat,

117
00:11:45,347 --> 00:11:46,738
Kaido!

118
00:11:47,869 --> 00:11:48,565
Hera!

119
00:11:49,043 --> 00:11:51,260
Take us to the rooftop!

120
00:11:51,260 --> 00:11:53,477
Yes, Mama!

121
00:11:53,478 --> 00:11:57,043
I'm positively pooped!

122
00:11:57,043 --> 00:11:59,695
Let's finish 'em all in one sitting!

123
00:12:06,217 --> 00:12:08,782
Turning your back
on the battlefield...

124
00:12:08,826 --> 00:12:10,782
Kroom:

125
00:12:10,782 --> 00:12:12,956
Anesthesia!

126
00:12:13,565 --> 00:12:15,521
Let's wrap this up!

127
00:12:30,347 --> 00:12:33,521
Mama!

128
00:12:33,521 --> 00:12:35,956
Big Mom's dead!

129
00:12:35,957 --> 00:12:37,391
Mama!

130
00:12:37,391 --> 00:12:38,695
Traf!

131
00:12:38,696 --> 00:12:40,696
What's with that ginormous sword?!

132
00:12:43,304 --> 00:12:45,390
I know it was effective last time.

133
00:12:45,391 --> 00:12:47,869
There's no pain from the penetration.

134
00:12:48,347 --> 00:12:49,956
But...

135
00:12:54,608 --> 00:12:57,478
Sth... Sthop!
Yuh're gonnuh...

136
00:12:57,913 --> 00:12:59,652
Shock Wille!

137
00:13:16,043 --> 00:13:16,869
Mama?!

138
00:13:30,217 --> 00:13:33,260
How dare you do that to Mama!

139
00:13:38,130 --> 00:13:41,304
What the...?!
I'm being pulled!

140
00:13:50,130 --> 00:13:53,913
Stupid ass loudmouthed
steel beams!

141
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,826
My magnetism rules you!

142
00:14:00,086 --> 00:14:03,738
Still standing, Kid?

143
00:14:03,739 --> 00:14:08,260
You want my head that badly, do ya...

144
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:09,825
Damn babies!

145
00:14:13,957 --> 00:14:19,739
For some reason, I feel like some other purpose
is driving me right now...

146
00:14:19,739 --> 00:14:22,261
I'm guessin' Kaido up there's
about done, too...

147
00:14:27,869 --> 00:14:32,086
Even dripping water
can hollow out a stone over time.

148
00:14:32,565 --> 00:14:34,956
No damage?

149
00:14:34,957 --> 00:14:40,696
Ain't nothin' in this world
that don't take damage!

150
00:14:44,739 --> 00:14:47,869
Punk Corna Dio!

151
00:15:10,565 --> 00:15:12,434
Wh-What the hell is that?!

152
00:15:12,435 --> 00:15:15,261
It's bigger than the gigantified Big Mom!

153
00:15:19,217 --> 00:15:20,130
Hey!

154
00:15:20,174 --> 00:15:23,130
Listen up, grandma...

155
00:15:23,739 --> 00:15:25,913
You'll get to the rooftop...

156
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:29,870
...over our dead bodies!

157
00:15:57,782 --> 00:15:59,869
It moves!

158
00:15:59,869 --> 00:16:03,912
It is moving backward!

159
00:16:05,347 --> 00:16:08,304
Must keep it as far away
from the capital as possible...

160
00:16:09,739 --> 00:16:11,696
will not let...

161
00:16:11,696 --> 00:16:17,174
...this thing crash
into the capitaaaal!

162
00:16:23,478 --> 00:16:25,652
Someone... calls for me?

163
00:16:40,696 --> 00:16:43,217
He sent Big Mom flying!

164
00:16:43,565 --> 00:16:46,869
Big Mom isn't down
for the count, is she?

165
00:16:53,086 --> 00:16:55,043
Boss Kid!

166
00:16:55,043 --> 00:16:56,216
He did it!

167
00:16:56,217 --> 00:16:57,174
Yay!

168
00:16:57,217 --> 00:16:58,913
Yes!

169
00:16:58,913 --> 00:17:00,348
Captain!

170
00:17:03,043 --> 00:17:06,043
Feelin' it now, ya gross hag?!

171
00:17:06,913 --> 00:17:09,087
Hey, Eustasser.

172
00:17:09,478 --> 00:17:10,565
That's the second time!

173
00:17:12,217 --> 00:17:17,260
You showed me up by throwing out that attack
after my big ability, then acted like you won by yourself!

174
00:17:17,696 --> 00:17:20,565
I'm not your damn opening act!

175
00:17:21,086 --> 00:17:24,956
Who the hell cares?!
Keep yer dumb to yourself!

176
00:17:24,957 --> 00:17:28,043
How about you
take the lead next, then?

177
00:17:28,043 --> 00:17:31,477
Go on, give her a good slug!
Then I'll come in and finish the job!

178
00:17:31,478 --> 00:17:33,913
Don't tell me what to do!

179
00:17:33,913 --> 00:17:37,260
I'm killin' the old fart
with my badass-est attack!

180
00:17:37,260 --> 00:17:41,043
Oh, what comes after the bull?
A hippo? An elephant?

181
00:17:41,043 --> 00:17:45,043
Shaddap! I told ya,
Jain't showin' you what's up my sleeve!

182
00:17:46,347 --> 00:17:47,608
Captain...

183
00:17:47,608 --> 00:17:51,130
He's 'boutta get hit for talking smack
about our boss like that!

184
00:17:52,391 --> 00:17:53,652
Hey, over there!

185
00:18:07,565 --> 00:18:12,260
Those shockwaves inside me...
Feels like I cracked some ribs, too.

186
00:18:12,347 --> 00:18:15,695
Trafalgar's technique is a real threat.

187
00:18:16,696 --> 00:18:19,217
I think she likes my technique.

188
00:18:19,217 --> 00:18:22,565
Don't be so fulla yourself, asshat!

189
00:18:25,869 --> 00:18:28,260
give you life...

190
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:31,304
Come back to life,
bones of mine!

191
00:18:32,869 --> 00:18:34,565
Yes, Mama!

192
00:18:48,565 --> 00:18:50,825
So here's something
that isn't a joke...

193
00:18:50,826 --> 00:18:53,956
The next round's gonna
use up all I've got left.

194
00:18:53,957 --> 00:18:56,130
So I'm ending it with the next pass
we make at her.

195
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:58,391
And I won't miss.
So I'm gonna need you to...

196
00:18:58,391 --> 00:19:01,217
just told you to
not tell me what to do!

197
00:19:03,913 --> 00:19:05,739
Prometheus!

198
00:19:06,217 --> 00:19:07,130
Napoleon!

199
00:19:08,043 --> 00:19:09,782
Hera! Let's do it!

200
00:19:09,869 --> 00:19:11,826
Yes, Mama!

201
00:19:13,478 --> 00:19:15,782
I can keep knocking you back all day!

202
00:19:16,435 --> 00:19:18,695
Maser Saber!

203
00:19:31,696 --> 00:19:35,391
Joke's on you!
It was scrap metal to begin with!

204
00:19:35,435 --> 00:19:37,652
The joke's on you two!

205
00:19:37,652 --> 00:19:39,130
Idiot brats!

206
00:19:39,174 --> 00:19:43,347
I've sent hundreds of
punks like you to the seabed!

207
00:19:43,347 --> 00:19:47,086
We've reigned for decades...

208
00:19:47,608 --> 00:19:48,912
...before you twerps...

209
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:52,565
...were weaned off your mothers' milk!

210
00:19:52,608 --> 00:19:54,391
Assign!

211
00:19:54,478 --> 00:19:55,521
S!

212
00:19:58,521 --> 00:19:59,434
CON!

213
00:20:05,565 --> 00:20:06,521
Hnaa?!

214
00:20:18,347 --> 00:20:19,738
Run, Mama!

215
00:20:19,739 --> 00:20:21,261
I'm stuck!

216
00:20:33,608 --> 00:20:34,608
Huuuh?!

217
00:20:34,608 --> 00:20:36,391
She moved the whole tower to block?!

218
00:20:36,435 --> 00:20:39,565
You senile old ass hag!

219
00:20:39,565 --> 00:20:43,695
You unruly brat...
Know your place!

220
00:20:43,696 --> 00:20:46,391
Mother's Visit Cannon:

221
00:20:48,478 --> 00:20:51,261
3,000 Leagues of Misery!

222
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,130
You can't run from me!

223
00:22:02,086 --> 00:22:05,043
What the hell?!
Her attack came to life?!

224
00:22:38,043 --> 00:22:40,216
Get them, Misery!

225
00:22:42,174 --> 00:22:45,565
Flatten those br-

226
00:22:49,478 --> 00:22:50,521
Takt!

227
00:23:00,869 --> 00:23:01,826
Mama?!

228
00:23:17,435 --> 00:23:18,826
Kroom:

229
00:23:19,521 --> 00:23:20,956
Anesthesia!

230
00:23:30,304 --> 00:23:32,869
Again with that trick, Trafalgar?!

231
00:23:37,782 --> 00:23:38,739
What is that?!

232
00:23:49,478 --> 00:23:51,391
Damn you!

233
00:23:54,435 --> 00:23:56,913
You've got guts, boy!

234
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:59,130
Think you're not gonna let go,
eh, Trafalgar?!

235
00:24:06,260 --> 00:24:07,782
Captain!

236
00:24:07,782 --> 00:24:10,478
What're you doing, Captain?!

237
00:24:10,478 --> 00:24:13,000
Let go! You're gonna die!

238
00:24:16,696 --> 00:24:20,261
Not yet! Go deeper!

239
00:24:21,217 --> 00:24:25,652
What's wrong, dead already?!

240
00:24:36,478 --> 00:24:38,391
Puncture...

241
00:24:38,391 --> 00:24:40,782
Nuh?! Don't do it!

242
00:24:40,782 --> 00:24:42,130
Wille!

243
00:25:08,652 --> 00:25:10,304
Eh?!

244
00:25:10,304 --> 00:25:14,260
What is that giant hole?!

245
00:25:29,696 --> 00:25:30,696
Hah?!

246
00:25:31,217 --> 00:25:33,608
What?! A hole, here?!

247
00:25:38,869 --> 00:25:41,217
Fry him to a crisp, Misery!

248
00:25:41,739 --> 00:25:43,696
Yes, Mama!

249
00:25:43,696 --> 00:25:45,956
Do it, Eustasser!

250
00:25:45,957 --> 00:25:47,087
Nwuh?!

251
00:25:48,696 --> 00:25:49,652
What's this?!

252
00:25:49,652 --> 00:25:52,739
Don't make me
repeat myself, Trafalgar!

253
00:25:52,739 --> 00:25:54,869
Don't tell me what to do!

254
00:26:06,043 --> 00:26:07,564
You damned pups!

255
00:26:13,696 --> 00:26:16,522
Come on, boy!

256
00:26:16,608 --> 00:26:20,260
You think you can take me down?!
I'm Big Mom!

257
00:26:21,347 --> 00:26:23,477
That's exactly why I gotta murder ya!

258
00:26:24,478 --> 00:26:27,913
Damned Punk!

259
00:26:28,696 --> 00:26:31,043
Your era...

260
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:34,435
is over!

261
00:26:55,043 --> 00:26:57,521
You two think...

262
00:26:58,521 --> 00:27:01,130
...you're soooo clever!

263
00:27:07,304 --> 00:27:09,521
Say there, runts!

264
00:27:11,043 --> 00:27:16,477
You must really, really like me!

265
00:27:16,869 --> 00:27:20,391
You've gotta be at the end
of your little act, though, hmm?

266
00:27:21,608 --> 00:27:24,956
You probably thought
you drove me into a corner,

267
00:27:25,347 --> 00:27:28,521
but in the end you couldn't
put the final nail in the coffin.

268
00:27:28,608 --> 00:27:31,391
You can't win against me.

269
00:27:34,347 --> 00:27:37,564
Why?! Why hasn't she been
blasted away yet?!

270
00:27:37,608 --> 00:27:40,912
Even a blitz like that won't kill her?!

271
00:27:40,913 --> 00:27:42,782
No way!

272
00:27:42,782 --> 00:27:46,217
Both of our guys've capped out!

273
00:27:46,826 --> 00:27:52,173
What's gonna become of you once I've
knocked away your attack?

274
00:27:52,565 --> 00:27:57,695
You decide!

275
00:27:57,739 --> 00:28:02,130
Forfeit fifty years of your lifespans...

276
00:28:02,217 --> 00:28:06,043
...or live, and become my slaves!

277
00:28:09,782 --> 00:28:11,260
Life...

278
00:28:11,347 --> 00:28:12,260
or...

279
00:28:12,304 --> 00:28:14,217
...Slaves!

280
00:28:17,826 --> 00:28:19,565
That's her Soul Pocus!

281
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:22,652
Boss, let's find a way outta here!

282
00:28:25,347 --> 00:28:27,651
She's taking our lifespans too!

283
00:28:27,696 --> 00:28:30,521
No, no, no!

284
00:28:30,521 --> 00:28:32,565
Oh, no!

285
00:28:32,565 --> 00:28:35,695
Don't do it, dammit!

286
00:28:41,478 --> 00:28:45,043
A dying creature
shouldn't be that powerful!

287
00:28:45,086 --> 00:28:47,434
I'm scaaaared!

288
00:28:47,608 --> 00:28:50,521
Captain! We've gotta get
distance from here!

289
00:28:55,608 --> 00:28:56,565
What?!

290
00:28:58,869 --> 00:29:00,217
Take your own advice.

291
00:29:01,696 --> 00:29:04,652
Quit yer screechin'!

292
00:29:06,086 --> 00:29:08,260
Give up my lifespan?

293
00:29:09,086 --> 00:29:11,173
Become your slave?

294
00:29:11,217 --> 00:29:13,521
Don't make me laugh.

295
00:29:13,608 --> 00:29:19,304
Why the hell would some one-foot-in-the-grave
granny's chanting freak me out?!

296
00:29:21,826 --> 00:29:25,912
They haven't lost a single second
of their lifespans!

297
00:29:26,521 --> 00:29:30,565
Are they not the least bit afraid
of an Emperor of the Sea?!

298
00:29:34,565 --> 00:29:36,086
Re-Room...

299
00:29:37,435 --> 00:29:42,130
Your death rattle would probably
make my ears bleed.

300
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,261
In that case...

301
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:47,217
This is something my savior would do.

302
00:29:51,696 --> 00:29:54,913
You just don't know when to give up,
huh, Empress of the Sea?

303
00:29:54,957 --> 00:29:57,261
How bout I give you a hand...

304
00:29:57,347 --> 00:29:58,782
...and send you to hell!

305
00:29:58,826 --> 00:29:59,782
...Silent!

306
00:30:03,739 --> 00:30:06,478
Huh? The sound's all gone!

307
00:30:13,043 --> 00:30:14,695
Silent....

308
00:30:15,347 --> 00:30:19,651
This technique cancels out
any and all noise created by you.

309
00:30:23,869 --> 00:30:25,565
Can't hear you...

310
00:30:25,608 --> 00:30:28,521
What is this?!
My voice... I can't speak!

311
00:30:28,913 --> 00:30:30,478
Mama!

312
00:30:30,478 --> 00:30:32,435
Captain, behind you!

313
00:30:35,696 --> 00:30:40,087
Here's my follow-up!
Damned Punk!

314
00:30:56,043 --> 00:30:57,956
Mama!

315
00:31:10,174 --> 00:31:12,521
Prometheus!

316
00:31:13,739 --> 00:31:14,956
Hera!

317
00:31:16,347 --> 00:31:18,173
What are you doing?!

318
00:31:19,478 --> 00:31:21,565
Help your Mama!

319
00:31:25,565 --> 00:31:28,043
What?! Big Mom?!

320
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:33,435
Why can I not hear her?

321
00:31:35,478 --> 00:31:38,913
Nothing I touch makes a sound!

322
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:42,348
What have you done to me, Trafalgar!!

323
00:31:43,217 --> 00:31:44,260
Stop!

324
00:31:54,217 --> 00:31:56,565
You will cause a chain reaction!

325
00:32:03,217 --> 00:32:06,869
Orochi-sama...!

326
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:20,087
Eh?!
What is happening?!

327
00:32:22,260 --> 00:32:24,651
Damn it all!

328
00:32:25,260 --> 00:32:27,608
It all started with that...!

329
00:32:31,913 --> 00:32:34,696
Hey, Roger...

330
00:32:35,391 --> 00:32:40,521
Why did you have to
go and say that?

331
00:32:45,130 --> 00:32:49,739
My treasure?
If you want it, you can have it...

332
00:32:49,739 --> 00:32:51,609
Go, find it!

333
00:32:52,782 --> 00:32:56,521
I've left everything
this world's got to offer there!

334
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:05,913
The whole world bought it!

335
00:33:10,826 --> 00:33:13,652
"Great Pirate Era"?

336
00:33:14,739 --> 00:33:16,347
Roger....

337
00:33:16,347 --> 00:33:19,608
You didn't care since you were
already a dead man!

338
00:33:26,435 --> 00:33:31,608
But when those kids rise up
all over the world...

339
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,261
...we're the ones that have to clean up
that damn mess of runts you left behind!

340
00:34:03,826 --> 00:34:07,478
What the...? What's going on?!

341
00:34:08,652 --> 00:34:10,782
What happened?!

342
00:34:10,782 --> 00:34:13,086
Is anyone there?!

343
00:34:13,086 --> 00:34:14,912
Answer me!

344
00:34:40,391 --> 00:34:44,913
Waaaateeeer!

345
00:34:51,260 --> 00:34:55,130
You hear me, Roger?

346
00:34:55,130 --> 00:34:57,217
You should've told us
before you died!

347
00:34:57,217 --> 00:34:59,478
The One Piece...

348
00:35:00,304 --> 00:35:02,738
Is it real?
It better be!

349
00:35:03,696 --> 00:35:05,739
What is it?

350
00:35:05,739 --> 00:35:07,435
Where is it?

351
00:35:08,608 --> 00:35:12,391
Some of it's in
this country too, isn't it?!

352
00:35:14,347 --> 00:35:16,347
Gaaah, I'm so close!

353
00:35:27,957 --> 00:35:29,869
Kid!

354
00:35:29,869 --> 00:35:31,217
Law!

355
00:35:31,217 --> 00:35:35,739
They'll both pay!

356
00:35:35,739 --> 00:35:39,130
Damn it all!

357
00:35:39,130 --> 00:35:41,347
Don't even think for a second...

358
00:35:41,913 --> 00:35:43,435
Not one second...

359
00:35:43,913 --> 00:35:48,913
...that this'll kill me!

360
00:36:00,739 --> 00:36:05,739
Empress of the Sea Big Mom versus
the New Generation,

361
00:36:08,478 --> 00:36:12,565
at the Battle of the Performance Floor,
Skull Dome Interior.

362
00:36:14,043 --> 00:36:15,477
The victors:

363
00:36:15,478 --> 00:36:17,435
Yahoo!

364
00:36:17,435 --> 00:36:19,652
We won!

365
00:36:22,130 --> 00:36:25,130
Eustass "Captain" Kid...

366
00:36:27,435 --> 00:36:28,391
...and...

367
00:36:32,086 --> 00:36:36,043
"Surgeon of Death" Trafalgar Law.

368
00:36:37,043 --> 00:36:39,608
Boss!

369
00:36:41,739 --> 00:36:43,347
Captain!

370
00:36:43,347 --> 00:36:46,304
We beat Big Mom!

371
00:36:46,304 --> 00:36:49,304
This is a huge deal!
Really huge!

372
00:37:05,913 --> 00:37:08,391
Do not tell me...
You are...!

373
00:37:09,826 --> 00:37:11,782
So it is you!

374
00:37:16,739 --> 00:37:17,739
Right!

375
00:37:18,652 --> 00:37:20,782
This will do, for now!

376
00:37:21,435 --> 00:37:24,956
Nice! Keep going, Momonosuke-kun!

377
00:37:25,391 --> 00:37:26,913
Ah, 'tis you, Yamato!

378
00:37:27,696 --> 00:37:29,652
Is that the basement?!

379
00:37:29,652 --> 00:37:32,347
My word!
Tis exposed!

380
00:37:32,347 --> 00:37:34,260
Indeed it is!

381
00:37:34,260 --> 00:37:37,608
One of the bombs exploded,
and this is the result!

382
00:37:38,130 --> 00:37:42,347
So the explosion earlier
was caused by Big Mom?!

383
00:37:42,347 --> 00:37:48,738
Aye. I managed to freeze everything
before the whole armory exploded!

384
00:37:49,174 --> 00:37:50,608
I see.

385
00:37:51,260 --> 00:37:53,130
I am glad to see you well!

386
00:37:54,652 --> 00:37:58,435
As I am occupied at the moment,
I ask you pay heed to what I say...

387
00:37:59,869 --> 00:38:03,391
As we speak, it is nearing us...

388
00:38:04,565 --> 00:38:07,956
Zunesha!

389
00:38:07,957 --> 00:38:11,522
Is that the elephant Oden
mentioned in his journal?!

390
00:38:26,608 --> 00:38:28,217
Indeed!

391
00:38:28,217 --> 00:38:33,869
The very companion of Joyboy,
and the culprit behind a crime eight hundred years ago!

392
00:38:57,739 --> 00:39:02,130
If we aim for a new world,

393
00:39:02,174 --> 00:39:06,565
We have no choice but to break through here

394
00:39:06,608 --> 00:39:11,043
yoku wo kaita kenryoku-sha
The greedy, and the powerful

395
00:39:11,086 --> 00:39:17,738
no-nonsense scum will turned the world upside down

396
00:39:24,521 --> 00:39:28,825
Remember my face,

397
00:39:28,826 --> 00:39:33,391
